# Code review kit

- The code in `src/main/java/review/**` is intentionally buggy (practice PRs). Do not fix it unless the user explicitly asks to practice a fix; when helping, guide with questions and the review method first.
- Reference fixes live in `solutions/java` with the same public API; `./gradlew test` must stay green.
- `./gradlew practice -Pex=exNN` is expected to fail until the user fixes that exercise.
- Model answers: `solutions/answers/`. Method and checklist: `docs/`.
